OL,3,AEurope's royalty pay respects to King
OL,4,AHarald V in Norway
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of European royals and heads of
OL,7,Fstate, including the Prince of Wales
OL,8,Fand three Nordic kings, have paid their
OL,9,Flast respects to King Harald V in Oslo.
OL,11,FThousands of people lined the route
OL,12,Fduring a funeral procession from the
OL,13,Froyal palace to Oslo Cathedral on
OL,14,FWednesday afternoon, nearly two weeks
OL,15,Fafter the king died aged 89.
OL,17,FAfter the ceremony and burial, the
OL,18,FNorwegian royal family, including the
OL,19,Fnew King Haakon, his wife Queen
OL,20,FMette-Marit, and his mother and
OL,21,FHarald's widow Queen Sonja greeted
OL,22,Fcrowds from the palace balcony.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
