OL,3,AEurope's royalty pay respects to King
OL,4,AHarald V in Norway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minute's silence was also observed
OL,7,Fthroughout the country. Harald, who was
OL,8,Fseen as a popular, modernising figure,
OL,9,Fwas on the Norwegian throne for 35
OL,10,Fyears.
